        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare genetic connective tissue disorder typically characterized by the association of unexpected organ fragility (arterial/bowel/gravid uterine rupture) with inconstant physical features as thin translucent skin easy bruising and acrogeric traits."
        },
